        "accordion_ByhxAr": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>Product Details</p>",
            "video_link": "",
            "content": "<ul><li>✨ WHITENING STRIPS FOR SENSITIVE TEETH & GUMS — Specially designed for delicate smiles, these whitening strips gently lift stains without causing pain, irritation, or gum discomfort perfect for daily use on sensitive teeth.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>🌿 PEROXIDE-FREE W/ ALL-NATURAL & GENTLE FORMULA — Whiten without harsh chemicals. Our peroxide-free whitening strips use a gentler, natural ingredients-inspired approach to remove stains safely and comfortably.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>🦷 ENAMEL-SAFE FORMULA THAT PROTECTS YOUR TEETH — Formulated to protect your enamel while whitening effectively. Achieve a brighter smile without weakening tooth structure or risking long-term enamel damage.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>👩‍⚕️ DENTIST APPROVED & RECOMMENDED — Developed with oral-care best practices in mind and trusted by dental professionals as a safer alternative to aggressive peroxide whitening treatments.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>🔒 EASY, NON-SLIP APPLICATION — The dry-strip technology keeps strips in place for the full 30-minute treatment without sliding around.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>⚡ EASY TO USE, FAST ACTING VISIBLE RESULTS — Apply for just 30 minutes a day and enjoy noticeably whiter teeth in just days. For best results, wear for 30 minutes and avoid eating or drinking for 1 hour after use.</li></ul>",
